  "releaseNotes": "Updated to .NET 10 and EF Core 10.0.15. Fixes: DetachNodeAsync/RemoveNodeAsync on PostgreSQL and SQL Server; SetParentAsync when moving a root with descendants; async enumeration of QueryAncestors on a root. Behaviour changes: SetParentAsync throws InvalidOperationException on cycles; untracked entities are attached and saved. Breaking: Query() and QueryRoots() return IQueryable<TEntity> (non-nullable elements). Breaking behaviour: DetachNodeAsync and RemoveNodeAsync save once instead of once per child. Added ValidateAsync, IsAncestorOf and IsDescendantOf. IntIdentifierSerializer uses the invariant culture; negative int ids stored under cultures with a U+2212 minus sign need a one-off path update (see README). See the changelog in the README.",
